title: Crown Jewels
text: Each jewel is set where two bands of the crown meet, and it keeps only what they share.
trick: three logic gates; splitters in the valleys feed one colour to two gates, so red, yellow, cyan and blue make red, green and blue jewels
motif: a crown: a zigzag of beams with a gate and a jewel at each point
ink: 4
expect: shared>=4
